{"id":"650746","name":"椰奶冻","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/650746/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"椰奶汁","amount":"200g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"300g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"40g"}],"sub":[{"name":"吉利丁片","amount":"15g"},{"name":"椰子肉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"吉利丁片用水泡一下，椰子肉切丁。","img":"images/650746/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"椰子肉加水，加糖，用榨汁机榨成汁。","img":"images/650746/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小火加热后，放入吉利丁片慢慢化开。","img":"images/650746/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入盒中放入冰箱冷藏一宿。","img":"images/650746/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拿出。","img":"images/650746/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/650746/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"清香椰味。","img":"images/650746/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：榨汁机\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}